{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25478","headline":"思平泉树石杂咏一十首 似鹿石 · 李德裕","name":"思平泉树石杂咏一十首 似鹿石","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"林中有奇石，髣髴兽潜行。\n乍似依岩桂，还疑食野苹。\n茸长绿藓映，斑细紫苔生。\n不是见羇者，何劳如顿缨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25478.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25478","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}